== Trivia ==
* The item is a reference to Poké Balls from the [[wikipedia:Pokémon|Pokémon]] franchise. Ironically, it doesn't at all resemble the [http://vignette2.wikia.nocookie.net/pokemon/images/d/d4/Ball-friend1.png/revision/latest?cb=20110521124009 actual Friend Ball] in the franchise.
* The Friendly Ball’s design represents Isaac’s eye depicted by the release button and the blue line representing his tears.
